WEBVTT

00:03.223 --> 00:07.747
Thank you. We're gonna slow things down for you

00:07.807 --> 00:09.128
for just a minute.

00:17.616 --> 00:21.779
The streetlights make a blurry line.

00:25.102 --> 00:30.067
I'm running through the same old signs.

00:33.020 --> 00:36.383
I'm just a face in a passing crowd

00:39.045 --> 00:44.389
Afraid to speak my thoughts out loud

00:47.371 --> 00:51.934
But then you found me in the noise

00:54.756 --> 00:59.220
You heard a whisper in my voice

01:02.616 --> 01:06.741
You gave me something to believe,

01:08.703 --> 01:10.705
a reason I wouldn't

01:15.850 --> 01:23.532
If you walked away, the sky would lose its blue. I

01:23.612 --> 01:30.274
wouldn't know what to do. I'd be lost in the gray.

01:30.614 --> 01:39.117
If you walked away, my world would fall apart.

01:41.058 --> 01:42.678
You're the owner.

01:57.572 --> 02:02.117
They build these walls so high and steep

02:04.900 --> 02:09.204
With promises they never keep

02:12.688 --> 02:16.092
But we have a fortress, strong and true

02:18.803 --> 02:29.226
I'm safe as long as I have you. If you walked away,

02:29.306 --> 02:35.127
the sky would lose its blue. I wouldn't know what

02:35.187 --> 02:44.210
to do. I'd be lost in the gray. If you walked away,

02:44.590 --> 02:48.451
my world would fall apart.

02:51.153 --> 03:00.020
You're the owner of my neon heart

03:02.182 --> 03:11.129
I'm holding on, I'm holding tight Don't let me go

03:11.209 --> 03:13.450
into the night

03:19.603 --> 03:27.288
If you walked away, the sky would lose its blue. I

03:27.369 --> 03:33.893
wouldn't know what to do. I'd be lost in the gray.

03:34.353 --> 03:43.399
If you walked away, my world would fall apart.

03:44.820 --> 03:47.202
You're the owner of my heart.

04:00.948 --> 04:06.185
Don't walk away Thank

04:06.206 --> 04:06.948
you so much

